        "text": "Good morning, everyone, and welcome to our neighbourhood. I'm Hannah, and I've come to tell you about the community centre and some of the things you can do there. It's called Bracken Centre, that's B-R-A-C-K-E-N. People sometimes confuse it with the sports centre near the station, but we're on Mill Road, opposite the library. There's a small car park behind the building, though it fills up quickly on Saturdays. If you're coming by bus from the town centre, take the number eighteen, no, sorry, that's the old route. It's the number twenty-eight now. The stop is just outside our front gate, so you won't have far to walk."
