        "text": "The centre's open six days a week, from Monday to Saturday. We used to unlock the doors at nine, but these days we open at half past nine. Closing time varies because some groups meet in the evening, so it's worth checking before you come. You may have noticed some building work at the side. We thought about extending the main hall, but local people said they needed somewhere peaceful to work. So the new room will give visitors a quiet place to study. It'll have desks and free internet, and we hope it'll be ready by September. The main hall will stay open during the work."
